wait 50
mark
turn K2 1
wait 50
expect events 2
turn K4 1
wait 50
expect same 0
turn K1 1
key w4 down 100
wait 50
key w4 up
wait 50
expect events 6
expect cursor 8
tap PLAY
wait 1200
shot stepedit.png
tap PLAY
press EDIT
wait 800
release EDIT
wait 50
